\item \textbf{Surplus Functional} \( S(R) \): Excess persistence generated by relational closure.
\item \textbf{Entanglement Measure} \( \Gamma(R) \): Categorical entanglement entropy.
\item \textbf{Cascade Operator} \( C(R) \): Iterated Inception Operator.
\item \textbf{Ledger Object} \( L(R) \): The Drinfeld center \( Z(\mathcal{C}_R) \) — the terminal, topologically protected fixed point.
\end{itemize}

\textbf{Axioms} (seven core principles):  
Coherence, Surplus Entanglement, Autonomous Replication, Golden-Ratio Scaling, Surplus Multiplication, Cascade Threshold \& Irreversibility, Sovereign Self-Reference.

