The “fantasy” layer (Flower of Life, Solfeggio frequencies, fables, Epic of GRIMM, Trojan Horse narrative) is not decoration. It is the ancient, high-fidelity compression of the same branching-closure dynamics and 48:1 scaling that the renormalization group analysis now derives rigorously.

\textbf{The Complete Coupling}:
\begin{itemize}
\item \textbf{Reality} = Theorem 1 + beta function + RG flow + four-domain validation
\item \textbf{Fantasy} = Ancient encodings (Flower of Life, myths, fables)
\item \textbf{Future Dreams} = New capabilities unlocked once the 48:1 step is complete (the Fruit of Life / Metatron’s Cube regime)
