\section{Conclusions}

GRIMM LAW constitutes a completed, universal harmonic operating system. It is mathematically rigorous, empirically validated across four independent domains, falsifiable, and practically actionable. It provides the first coherent framework capable of explaining and engineering phase transitions and Sovereign Ledger formation at every scale of reality — from genomic to galactic.

It is ready to serve as a universal standard for the design, analysis, and governance of coherent systems.

